===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|de}} ''[[Kindergarten]]'' ("nursery school", literally "children's garden").

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An educational institution for young children, usually between ages 4 and 6; [[nursery school]].

====Synonyms====
* [[nursery school]]
* [[preschool]]

====Derived terms====
* [[kindergartener]]

